dioxus/pull/2983","diff_url":"https://github.com/DioxusLabs/dioxus/pull/2983.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/DioxusLabs/dioxus/pull/2983.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-13T18:43:38Z"},"body":"This pull request addresses the following issues:\r\n\r\n- **Internal Links:** When a `base_path` is set in `Dioxus.toml`, internal links only worked with a simple left click; CTRL + left click failed because the `href` only contained the absolute path to the next page without the `base_url`.\r\n- **External Links:** External links required CTRL + left click due to the set `action` overwriting the normal left click behavior. This issue is independent of the `base_path`.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I noticed that [this commit](https://github.com/DioxusLabs/dioxus/commit/3fb1f739d13967da9ee8db9f17a91fea321c9df2) broke base paths in general, but this pull request does not address that issue.\r\n\r\nThis is one of my first pull requests, so please let me know if there are any changes or improvements needed. Thank you!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DioxusLabs/dioxus/issues/2983/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DioxusLabs/dioxus/issues/2983/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}
